-- the question a candidate list is asking.
--
-- Specs absent from this table have no simulation data at all.
-- That is a fact about the source, not about the player, so the
-- panel says so in words instead of showing an empty or
-- arbitrarily ordered list.
--
-- DATA ONLY, ASCII ONLY. Item ids only; names resolve in game.

